  - [38;5;153msrc/truncate.js[39m → [38;5;153mtruncate(text, n)[39m: returns [38;5;153mtext[39m unchanged when it fits, otherwise cuts and appends an ellipsis.
    Test: [38;5;153msrc/truncate.test.js[39m.
